# Judge1-6-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open,Arms
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我认为凶手<br>除了汉娜别无人选。<br>并且，<br>有两项证据<br>都指向这件事……|#0101Trial06_Leia001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,50 Roll:-4

@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:1-1

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:第一件就是，<br>正如刚刚所证明的，<br>被雪莉偷走<br>并破坏了的弩枪。|#0101Trial06_Leia002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,24 Roll:0
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我只是借来用了一下，<br>稍微把它<br>拆散了一下而已～！|#0101Trial06_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:65,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……总之，<br>在作案的<link=\"Objection_01_01_06_01\">时刻</link><br>弩枪已经被<link=\"Objection_01_01_06_02\">破坏</link>掉了，<br>也就是说，凶手<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_06_03\">无法使用</link>弩枪……|#0101Trial06_Leia003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:40,50 Roll:-4

@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:1-10
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR6,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:因此，<br>与情况吻合的结论就是，<br>凶手靠近诺亚后<br>【亲手戳刺了凶器】。|#0101Trial06_Leia004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,25 Roll:0

@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,-4 Scale:1.5 TintColor:#808080 Lazy:false ScenePosition:35,60 AppearanceAndTransition:270_2
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:而第二项证据就是，<br>涂成一片白色的<br>房间。|#0101Trial06_Leia005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,70 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:" 凶手能够<link=\"Objection_01_01_06_04\">不留任何痕迹</link>地<br>侵入房间内<link=\"Objection_01_01_06_05\">刺杀被害人</link>……<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_06_06\">而除了汉娜，没有其他人会飞</link>，<br>因此凶手除她之外别无可能。<br>|#0101Trial06_Leia006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:60,35 Roll:4

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Cry1,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:不对啦！<br>我什么<br>都没干啦～！|#0101Trial06_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,45 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那凶手其实还是<br>从外面投掷了箭咯？<br>这种话<br>现在还有人会信吗……？|#0101Trial06_Leia007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,50 Roll:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:如果你要反驳……<br>就请先证明<br>我说的话有错吧！<br>|#0101Trial06_Leia008| RevealSpeed:1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:true ProcessTimer:true
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

